================================================================================
2. SHADERPACK PIPELINE: PORT OF IRIS (GNU LGPL-3.0)
================================================================================

The shaderpack pipeline located under Java packages `net.pryzma.iris.*` is an
independent port of Iris (https://github.com/IrisShaders/Iris, branch 1.21.1,
version 1.8.14, commit eb7afb99f747cc8ed5ee4072119539035d33cefd).

Copyright (c) 2020-2024 Iris Contributors.

This component is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.0
(LGPL-3.0) as published by the Free Software Foundation. The complete license text
is provided in `META-INF/LICENSE-IRIS` and `META-INF/NOTICE-IRIS`.

All modifications made to the Iris codebase in Pryzma are released under the terms
of the LGPL-3.0, including:
- Decoupling from Sodium/Oculus runtimes to natively support vanilla/Pryzma chunk paths;
- Vanilla chunk vertex attribute completion (block IDs, light emission in midBlock);
- Direct section collection and counting-sort shadow pass (O(N) shadow culling);
- Framebuffer and shader program state binding caches (GlBindingCache);
- Two-tier memoization for celestial dome sky colors (PrSkyColorMemo).

In accordance with LGPL-3.0 Section 4, the full corresponding source code for all
modifications is publicly available at: https://github.com/Sto3IV/Pryzma

